# 番茄小说去广告规则 (Clash classical)
# 使用: rule-provider (type: http, behavior: classical) 引用后路由到 REJECT
# 来源:
# https://raw.githubusercontent.com/changzhaoCZ/fqnovel-adrules/master/fqnovel-fxxk_ads
# https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zqzess/rule_for_quantumultX/master/AdguardHome/FanQieNovel.txt
# https://raw.giteeusercontent.com/eggward/miho_config/raw/master/fanqie.yaml
# https://gist.github.com/iOSleep/7bb72761970b806b798abca9b418565f
# https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/b/c/a/bca12a1eb7a4e390bb0b905f7aaf7e50a3e6dd4f.txt
# 原则: 只拦广告 SDK / 埋点 / 广告素材的精确域名, 不碰内容 API 与图片 CDN, 不做字节全域拦截

